From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: usb: allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb: Add the A733
 compatible

The USB0 port of the A733 has a MUSB OTG controller behind PHY 0 of
the Allwinner USB PHY, as the A523 has. Add an A733 compatible with the
A33 compatible as its fallback, like the A523.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted with a device tree that uses this
binding; the USB0 node binds and dtbs_check reports nothing.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/usb/allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb.yaml
index 7ffcd236d7bb..33b8721c09aa 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/allwinner,sun4i-a10-musb.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ properties:
               - allwinner,sun50i-a100-musb
               - allwinner,sun50i-h6-musb
               - allwinner,sun55i-a523-musb
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-musb
           - const: allwinner,sun8i-a33-musb
       - items:
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-h616-musb
